    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "brief",
        "field": "question",
        "content": "林舟昨晚到过留白咖啡吗?",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "brief",
        "field": "body",
        "content": "乔岚猜他去过——那里有一张写着他名字的订单。你的任务是核实,不是替她证明。",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "brief",
        "field": "carry",
        "content": "乔岚的委托:核实订单,别把猜测当记录",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "route",
        "field": "walk",
        "content": "约 6 分钟",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "route",
        "field": "todo",
        "content": "找到柜台旁带城瘾游戏标识的展示台",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "opener",
        "content": "找林舟?咖啡可以凉,名字不能乱往单子上写。你找的是哪一张?",
        "nodeIndex": 0,
        "npcId": 102
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "aside",
        "content": "乔岚(通讯):先别替任何人下结论。也包括我。",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "q",
        "content": "你昨晚见过他吗?",
        "nodeIndex": 0,
        "qid": "night"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "a",
        "content": "没见到他本人。我见到的是来拿东西的人。",
        "nodeIndex": 0,
        "qid": "night"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "q",
        "content": "他平时是什么样的人?",
        "nodeIndex": 0,
        "qid": "who"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "a",
        "content": "会给纸袋编号,忘了给自己点吃的。",
        "nodeIndex": 0,
        "qid": "who"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "q",
        "content": "除了订单,还有什么想说的?",
        "nodeIndex": 0,
        "qid": "more"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "a",
        "content": "有一张旧照片,我一直不敢替别人讲完。等你们查清楚再说。",
        "nodeIndex": 0,
        "qid": "more"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "unlock",
        "field": "hook",
        "content": "许闻拿走了复制索引——而他写的展签上说:「第七码头,从未存在。」",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "node",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "title",
        "content": "名字没错,但我们问错了人。",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "line",
        "content": "「预约的人和来拿东西的人,本来就不是同一个。谢谢你没急着替他下结论。」",
        "nodeIndex": 0,
        "npcId": 102
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "lineIfFail",
        "content": "「预约人写的是林舟,来拿的是许闻。剩下的,你们自己去问。」",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "fact",
        "content": "许闻代领了复制索引(交接 071)",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "fact",
        "content": "预约不等于到场:签收栏是空白",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "open",
        "content": "林舟在哪里?原件又在哪里?",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "deliver",
        "field": "reward",
        "content": "调查纪念章 × 1",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "deliver",
        "field": "line",
        "content": "你们分清了预约和到场。这个,现在可以交给你们。",
        "nodeIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "brief",
        "field": "question",
        "content": "许闻拿走的复制索引,里面写了什么?",
        "nodeIndex": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "brief",
        "field": "body",
        "content": "交接 071 由许闻代领。去书店核对他整理的展览稿,看展签的说法有没有走得比证据更远。",
        "nodeIndex": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "brief",
        "field": "carry",
        "content": "签收联 071:许闻代领复制索引",
        "nodeIndex": 1,
        "when": {
          "var": "clue.receipt_071",
          "op": "GTE",
          "value": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "route",
        "field": "walk",
        "content": "约 6 分钟",
        "nodeIndex": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "route",
        "field": "todo",
        "content": "找到门边的资料展示架",
        "nodeIndex": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "opener",
        "content": "「我确实去拿过。复制件都在展示架上,按交接号归档。原件不在我这儿。」他指向门边的展签:第七码头,从未存在。",
        "nodeIndex": 1,
        "npcId": 103
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "q",
        "content": "这张展签是谁写的?",
        "nodeIndex": 1,
        "qid": "label"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "a",
        "content": "我整理的。编号部分,乔岚核对过。",
        "nodeIndex": 1,
        "qid": "label"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "q",
        "content": "原件在哪?",
        "nodeIndex": 1,
        "qid": "orig"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "a",
        "content": "不在我这儿。我只经手复制件。",
        "nodeIndex": 1,
        "qid": "orig"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "unlock",
        "field": "hook",
        "content": "乔岚说她核对过编号——样张边栏上的,正是 QL。",
        "nodeIndex": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "node",
        "nodeIndex": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "title",
        "content": "他不再解释,但记录还在。",
        "nodeIndex": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "line",
        "content": "「你说得对,缩短了范围,意思就变了。样张给你,边栏上有上次的核对标记。」",
        "nodeIndex": 1,
        "npcId": 103
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "lineIfFail",
        "content": "「先别替我安排动机。公开样张在展示夹里,你自己看。」",
        "nodeIndex": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "fact",
        "content": "札记只检索了官方编号,展签却写成「从未存在」",
        "nodeIndex": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "fact",
        "content": "样张边栏有核对标记:QL",
        "nodeIndex": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "fact",
        "content": "口述补注原件:居民称其为第七码头",
        "nodeIndex": 1,
        "when": {
          "var": "clue.oral_note",
          "op": "GTE",
          "value": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "open",
        "content": "QL 是谁?",
        "nodeIndex": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "deliver",
        "field": "reward",
        "content": "检索札记复刻书签",
        "nodeIndex": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "deliver",
        "field": "line",
        "content": "许闻把书签夹进一本旧目录:「这是复刻件,别当原件。」",
        "nodeIndex": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "brief",
        "field": "question",
        "content": "展签的错,是谁的?",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "brief",
        "field": "body",
        "content": "你带着两份互相矛盾的材料,以及样张上的 QL 标记。去会客厅,把问题问回给委托人。",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "brief",
        "field": "carry",
        "content": "签收联 071",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "brief",
        "field": "carry",
        "content": "检索札记",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "brief",
        "field": "carry",
        "content": "QL 核对样张",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "route",
        "field": "walk",
        "content": "约 5 分钟",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "route",
        "field": "todo",
        "content": "找到会客厅中央的复核桌",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "opener",
        "content": "「桌子借你。别把别人的一句话,和你自己猜的一句话,装进同一个袋子。」乔岚的通讯接进了会客厅的屏幕。",
        "nodeIndex": 2,
        "npcId": 104
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "q",
        "content": "这里有校对人员登记吗?",
        "nodeIndex": 2,
        "qid": "roster"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "enter",
        "field": "a",
        "content": "墙上那张缩写表,公开的。",
        "nodeIndex": 2,
        "qid": "roster"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "unlock",
        "field": "hook",
        "content": "原始索引里,有一分钟没有进入公开稿。",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "node",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "title",
        "content": "这一次,记录没有替人撒谎。",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "line",
        "content": "「我只对了编号,没查口述补注。你找出的问题成立。但我不知道林舟为什么不回——别因为我错了一件事,就把另一件也算成我做的。」",
        "nodeIndex": 2,
        "npcId": 101
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "lineIfFail",
        "content": "「是我核的编号。别的,我现在不想谈。」",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "fact",
        "content": "QL = 乔岚,只核对了编号",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "fact",
        "content": "展签登记有限更正:未见正式编号,仍需核对口述资料",
        "nodeIndex": 2,
        "when": {
          "var": "counter.stage1_result",
          "op": "GTE",
          "value": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "fact",
        "content": "展签暂缓使用,留下复核待办",
        "nodeIndex": 2,
        "when": {
          "var": "counter.stage1_result",
          "op": "LTE",
          "value": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "open",
        "content": "原件去向与林舟停止回执的原因,仍未查明。",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "deliver",
        "field": "reward",
        "content": "夜航会客厅复核回执",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "deliver",
        "field": "line",
        "content": "老周在回执上盖了章:「第一阶段,结了。」",
        "nodeIndex": 2
      }
    ]
