        "content": "「我可以删去不公开的声音,但不该删去解释。」",
        "nodeIndex": 0,
        "npcId": 103
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "beat": "outcome",
        "field": "lineIfFail",
        "content": "「……剪辑确实没标缺段。这点我认。」",
        "nodeIndex": 0
